## Files
run                    : simulation running script
TB_MOON.v              : Test Bench
ahbtask.v              : MCU AMBA task
flist_moon.f           : file list
infile.mst             : Configuration & Interrupt Service Routine
infile_usb             : USB configuration
reg_define.v           : Address Map & Internal Register Define

## Directories

./---                  :  simulation running root
    |
    |
    |-- ncrun_script   :  Simulation script with Paramet Setting
    |
    |-- usb_model      :  USB Model (Generate stimulus)
    |
    |-- log_files      :  Log files

